    ("gov_m5_34", "International Organizations: Prominent Nigerians in UN", "2010", "The eminent Nigerian jurist who served as President of the International Court of Justice (ICJ) from 1982 to 1985 was:", ["Justice Taslim Olawale Elias", "Justice Bola Ajibola", "Justice Daddy Onyeama", "Justice Charles Onyeama"], 0, "Judge Taslim Elias was elected President of the World Court (ICJ) in 1982, having previously served as Chief Justice of Nigeria.", "Easy"),
