    ("gov_m5_42", "International Organizations: OPEC Secretary-General", "2012", "Which prominent Nigerian petroleum engineer and minister served as Secretary-General and Conference President of OPEC during crucial oil stabilization eras?", ["Dr. Rilwanu Lukman", "Prof. Jibril Aminu", "Chief Festus Okotie-Eboh", "Dr. K.O. Mbadiwe"], 0, "Dr. Rilwanu Lukman served multiple terms as OPEC Conference President and Secretary-General from 1995 to 2000.", "Medium"),
    ("gov_m5_43", "Foreign Policy: Bakassi Peninsula", "2012", "The territorial border dispute between Nigeria and Cameroon over the oil-rich Bakassi Peninsula was adjudicated in 2002 by the:", ["International Court of Justice (ICJ)", "ECOWAS Court of Justice", "African Union Assembly", "United Nations Security Council"], 0, "In October 2002, the ICJ delivered its judgment awarding sovereignty of Bakassi to Cameroon, leading to the 2006 Greentree Agreement handover.", "Easy"),
