    ("gov_m5_48", "International Organizations: ECOWAS Headquarters", "2011", "The administrative headquarters and Commission of ECOWAS is located in:", ["Abuja, Nigeria", "Lome, Togo", "Accra, Ghana", "Dakar, Senegal"], 0, "The ECOWAS Commission headquarters is situated in Asokoro, Abuja, Nigeria, while the ECOWAS Bank for Investment and Development (EBID) is in Lome, Togo.", "Easy"),
